From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 04:01:55 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ntdll: Cancel a synchronous request that a user APC
 interrupts, as Windows does.

When a user APC ends the wait for a request on a file opened for
alertable I/O, Windows cancels the request unless it is done, waits for
it, and returns its status; the APC runs on the way out.  Wine returned
STATUS_USER_APC and left the request running.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/dlls/ntdll/tests/pipe.c b/dlls/ntdll/tests/pipe.c
